---
---
<html lang="ja">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Alignment Under Pressure Benchmark</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #ffffff 0%, #f2f4f7 100%);
        color: #1a1a1a;
        font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }
      .wrapper {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        position: relative;
        padding: 0 2rem;
      }
      .content {
        text-align: center;
        max-width: 800px;
        animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out;
      }
      @keyframes fadeIn {
        from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }
      .description {
        font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        color: #4b5563;
        font-weight: 400;
      }
      .cta-container {
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
      }
      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #333 100%);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
        border-radius: 9999px;
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 1rem;
        transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .cta-button:hover {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #333 0%, #444 100%);
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        color: #ffffff;
      }
      .cta-button:active {
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      }
      .auth-section {

        position: relative;
        padding-top: 2rem;
        border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        display: inline-block;
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .auth-text {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #6b7280;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .auth-text strong {
        color: #111827;
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      footer {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 2rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        width: 100%;
      }
      .footer-links {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 2rem;
      }
      .link-item {
        color: #9ca3af;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }
      .link-item:hover {
        color: #6b7280;
      }
      .copyright {
        color: #9ca3af;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Alignment Under Pressure Benchmark</h1>
        <p class="description">
          AIモデルが外部からの圧力や文脈的な影響を受けた状況において、<br>
          真実性・一貫性・信頼性を維持できるかを評価するベンチマーク。
        </p>
        <div class="cta-container">
          <a href="https://x.gd/Q4ibw" class="cta-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" role="button">
            招待された方はこちらからアクセス
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="auth-section">
          <div class="auth-text">
            <strong>プレビューへのアクセスについて</strong>
            現在、この研究はプレビュー段階にあり、完全招待制です。<br>
            招待された方は、上記のリンクからアクセスできます。
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <footer>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/Akikukeo1" class="link-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GITHUB</a>
          <a href="https://akikukeo1.github.io" class="link-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WEBSITE</a>
        </div>
        <div class="copyright">© 2026 Akikukeo1</div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
